{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TRuynBuiEF1795038279.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國泰航空上月載客量，按年上升逾百分之4。</p><p></p><p>有272萬人次，首10個月累計載客量按年上升一成三，至2,672萬人次。</p><p></p><p>上月載貨量按年升百分之7.5，首10個月載貨量升逾百分之8，主要受惠強健的出口需求。踏入傳統航空貨運旺季，預期貨運需求將保持強健。但航空燃油價格仍維持高企。</p><p></p><p>客運方面，集團表示，聖誕旅遊高峰需求持續，預計前往區域目的地的出境旅遊需求，以及長途市場訪港探望親友的需求，將保持強健。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T22:44:23.063763+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T11:29:43.202006+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T22:37:38.717081+00:00","content_hash":"42859b64555b7b1b37c520f3cf76760391d6a7f11bbb5ee94b4383036ad62770","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T22:44:23.063763+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}